Contents</head><p>The material in Series II represents the study's final phases, and the period immediately following the publication of the Report. Included in Series II is a report entitled, "Summary of the Committee's Recommendations and Conclusions." This document provides an overview of the Committee's work and contains excerpts from certain sections of the flnal four-volume report. This series also contalns a set of inter-office memoranda together with excerpts of staff reports to the Foundation's Trustees. This compilation of material, filed as a slngle document, examines the Foundation's execution of the Study Committee's final recommendations on policy and planning.</p></scopecontent><arrangement id="bb386bc48a0be427b4c99cea596fc7ca"><head>Arrangement</head><p>The documents in Series II are arranged chronologically.</p></arrangement><c id="b50df75e4abe4f839fccc4a9281cfe1d" level="file"><did><unittitle>Foundation Trustees</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/533416</unitid><unitdate calendar="gregorian" datechar="creation" era="ce" normal="1948-11/1949-08" type="inclusive">1948 November-1949 August</unitdate><container altrender="Letter Document Box" id="8055bfc2e5b21ce7ee013ec77d9afafc" label="mixed materials [A0000000087963]" type="box">5</container><container id="0d7690d831b88ef39415cdd0cb2fe43b" parent="8055bfc2e5b21ce7ee013ec77d9afafc" type="folder">47</container></did></c><c id="560bfc9ea88046d198ad03695f1f9a15" level="file"><did><unittitle>Draft of the General Report</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/533417</unitid><unitdate calendar="gregorian" datechar="creation" era="ce">n.d.</unitdate><container altrender="Letter Document Box" id="378e6ba4c0fe95149698d1b0e7b319c4" label="mixed materials [A0000000087963]" type="box">5</container><container id="20b17303eb2129526eea19fe26059f60" parent="378e6ba4c0fe95149698d1b0e7b319c4" type="folder">48</container></did></c><c id="ddb49473b6ee4507a6